# Extending Interfaces (`extends`) 🧬

Interfaces can inherit properties from other interfaces:

```typescript
interface Person {
  name: string;
  age: number;
}

interface Employee extends Person {
  employeeId: string;
  department: string;
}

const staff: Employee = {
  name: "Sarah",
  age: 32,
  employeeId: "EMP-404",
  department: "Security"
};

console.log(staff);
```

