# Multiple Interface Inheritance 🌳

An interface can inherit from **multiple** parent interfaces simultaneously:

```typescript
interface HasId {
  id: string;
}

interface HasTimestamps {
  createdAt: Date;
  updatedAt: Date;
}

interface ProductRecord extends HasId, HasTimestamps {
  title: string;
  price: number;
}

const item: ProductRecord = {
  id: "PROD-101",
  createdAt: new Date(),
  updatedAt: new Date(),
  title: "Mechanical Keyboard",
  price: 120
};

console.log("Product:", item.title, "Price: $" + item.price);
```

