# Index Signatures 🔑

When you don't know the exact property names in advance, use an **Index Signature**:

```typescript
interface ErrorDictionary {
  // Allows any string key with a string value
  [fieldName: string]: string;
}

const formErrors: ErrorDictionary = {
  email: "Invalid email address format",
  password: "Must be at least 8 characters",
  zipCode: "Must be 5 digits"
};

console.log("Password Error:", formErrors["password"]);
```

